<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Themed-icon layer (Android 13+). Same Helm-boat geometry as
  ic_launcher_foreground — see that file for why every number is what it is;
  the two must stay in step or the themed icon becomes a different mark.

  The system tints this layer itself, so the fill/stroke is a flat white
  placeholder and must NOT be pre-tinted: a coloured glyph comes out wrong
  against a themed launcher. The sails/hull carry both a fill and a stroke so
  the mint-outline-over-white read of the colour icon survives as a solid
  silhouette here.
-->
